        <div class="right-sidebar-layout">
          <div class="left-content">
            <p>The <strong>Adafruit Gemma M0</strong> is a super small microcontroller board, with just enough built-in to create many simple projects. It may look small and cute: round, about the size of a quarter, with friendly alligator-clip sew pads. But do not be fooled! The Gemma M0 is incredibly powerful! We've taken the same form factor we used for&nbsp;<a href="../../www.adafruit.com/product/1222">the original ATtiny85-based Gemma</a>&nbsp;and gave it an upgrade. The Gemma M0 has swapped out the lightweight ATtiny85 for a ATSAMD21E18 powerhouse.</p>
